{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe air in Vienna is thick with the smell of roasted chestnuts and indifference. We spent the afternoon in the Prater; the crowds were immense, but the rides were dull. I paid two Gulden for a carriage that shook my teeth loose.\n\nDinner was late, at the old tavern near the Ring. The soup was cold, but the wine was a decent Zweigelt. I met Schuster afterward. He is a large man, loud as a trumpet, and claims his new role in *Die Zauberbirn* makes him the king of the stage. I suspect he is merely the loudest. I attended the performance tonight. The prelude was tedious, but Schuster’s merchant was surprisingly alive. The young wife, however, looked as if she wished to be anywhere else.\n\nI miss the quiet of our study. The heat here makes thinking difficult. I have bought a new coat; the tailor overcharged me, but the fabric is fine.\n\nYours,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795219040,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":214,"prompt_tokens":1083,"total_tokens":1297,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-ApdDikGLk2tucuP8Fe2mS9PvdsFEdUsx","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1083,"prompt_ms":1104.425,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0197830101569714,"prompt_per_second":980.6007651040134,"predicted_n":214,"predicted_ms":5090.096,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.897164319248823,"predicted_per_second":41.84596911335268}}